<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo-banner">演示模式 · 数据仅保存在本机，不会与网页版同步</view><view class="eyebrow">EVERY JOURNEY COUNTS</view><view class="heading">下一站，一起去哪里？</view><view class="subtitle">把账算清，把快乐留给旅程。</view><view class="hero"><view class="hero-sun"></view><view class="hero-hill"></view><view class="hero-title"><view>一起看世界，</view><view>也一起分担。</view></view><view class="hero-detail"><view>邀请朋友同行，随手记下花费。</view><view>谁该付给谁，我们来算。</view></view><button class="button primary hero-action" bindtap="create">＋ 创建新旅行</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{creating}}" class="card"><view class="card-title">开启一段新旅程</view><text class="form-label">旅行名称</text><input class="input" maxlength="60" value="{{form.name}}" placeholder="例如：青岛，去海边放个假" data-field="name" bindinput="field"/><text class="form-label">目的地</text><input class="input" maxlength="60" value="{{form.destination}}" placeholder="例如：山东 · 青岛" data-field="destination" bindinput="field"/><view class="grid2"><view><text class="form-label">开始日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.startDate}}" data-field="startDate" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{form.startDate}}</view></picker></view><view><text class="form-label">结束日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.endDate}}" data-field="endDate" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{form.endDate}}</view></picker></view></view><text class="form-label">结算币种</text><picker range="{{currencyLabels}}" value="{{currencyIndex}}" bindchange="currency"><view class="picker">{{currencyLabels[currencyIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="help">首笔支出录入后，币种将锁定。</view><view class="actions"><button class="button ghost" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="create">取消</button><button class="button primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">创建旅行</button></view></view><view class="tabs"><button class="tab {{!archived?'active':''}}" data-archived="false" bindtap="tab">进行中</button><button class="tab {{archived?'active':''}}" data-archived="true" bindtap="tab">已归档</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在整理旅行账本…</view><view wx:elif="{{!shown.length}}" class="card empty"><view class="empty-icon">◌</view><view class="empty-title">{{archived?'还没有归档的旅行':'你的第一段旅程，从这里开始'}}</view><view class="empty-detail">创建旅行，邀请朋友，再记下第一笔共同花费。</view></view><view wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="card trip-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row between"><view class="badge">{{item.archived?'已归档':'一起旅行中'}}</view><text class="tiny">{{item.currency}}</text></view><view class="trip-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">⌁ {{item.destination}}</view><view class="trip-dates">{{item.startDate}} — {{item.endDate}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row between"><text class="muted">{{item.memberCount}} 位同行</text><view><text class="tiny">总支出　</text><text class="amount">{{item.totalText}}</text></view></view></view><view class="help">下拉刷新，在不同设备继续同一本账。</view></view>
